        </table></ix:nonNumeric></div><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</span></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</span></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">The effective tax rate for the three months ended June 30, 2026, was significantly greater than (</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_4594ad95-b70d-492f-a5aa-9aa7d5508e2f" contextRef="C_0c6fdb7c-0b9c-413a-b6b0-04580a8e27ff" name="us-gaap:EffectiveIncomeTaxRateReconciliationTaxExemptIncome" unitRef="U_pure" scale="-2" decimals="2" sign="-" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">100</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">)% due to non-deductible executive compensation and excess tax expense arising from stock-based compensation combined with a near break-even pre-tax loss.</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </span></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</span></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">As of June 30, 2026 and June 30, 2025, the Company maintained a valuation allowance of approximately $</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_ef1a9fa2-bbd6-4e3b-a179-2e7411a28152" contextRef="C_d7ef17ab-507c-4b51-b54f-c69291d8fec8" name="mhh:DeferredTaxLiabilitiesValuationAllowance" unitRef="U_USD" scale="3" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal"><ix:nonFraction id="F_91c78a8b-d6a6-4ef7-abbd-9f5b28b14ed8" contextRef="C_57afb06c-7a37-45a2-b8c1-03b675bfa3e1" name="mhh:DeferredTaxLiabilitiesValuationAllowance" unitRef="U_USD" scale="3" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal"><ix:nonFraction id="F_83dcb3a1-8bc7-4b12-99ca-1e9154e133ea" contextRef="C_857a8fb0-6480-4e01-b30e-638cb94217ab" name="mhh:DeferredTaxLiabilitiesValuationAllowance" unitRef="U_USD" scale="3" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal"><ix:nonFraction id="F_94daf1f5-afab-427c-a28e-2dcab67ddbd4" contextRef="C_aa4c52d3-d782-4dd9-a148-f7d3a53ed6ea" name="mhh:DeferredTaxLiabilitiesValuationAllowance" unitRef="U_USD" scale="3" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">452,000</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> against net operating losses in Ireland and the United Kingdom that may not be realized.</span></p></ix:continuation></div></div></div>
